    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm runnign into a massive headache with our jenkins pipeline. the unit test stage is being super flaky. it'll pass fine one time, then fail the next with totally different error logs, even though we haven't touched the code. seems like it's something environmental or non-deterministic. any idea how i can start isolating what's causing these intermittent failures?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
