      "content": "When dealing with intermittent unit test failures, start by investigating the last few passes that failed, including any exception messages or output. Check the Jenkins console output to see if there are any patterns or clues that can point to the issue.\n\nNext, try using a deblocking tool like Derigger from Sonatype, which helps in isolating deterministic versus non-deterministic test cases. You can also try running each test individually through Jenkins' node to see if the failure is reproducible.",
